{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "818153226f4f7a709abab9163ae6099899eb1ac9113d85793a6768134782e338", "ja": "今日は宣材写真の撮影だ。\nところで茜、宣材写真のことは……。", "zh": "今天要拍摄宣传照。\n话说茜，你知道什么是宣传照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "c812e0aedc7ea664257cbe01ba8b8dd494d87e8b7ca70bacde74b7c7cd0ad582", "ja": "も～{$P$}ちゃんたら。そんなに\n茜ちゃんの写真を撮りたい？　セッキョクテキだな～♪", "zh": "真是的～小{$P$}就这么\n想拍小茜的照片吗？真是积极呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "d390ca7fdcad4ef54dee69ce63ae325c13e1f0d27df464511dc3fb769ff2a290", "ja": "カワいさって……罪！", "zh": "可爱……是一种罪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a7d6e913d187c4559971b08d7f10f97245c6fe92e7bca3c3d53e8d0f68db14ef", "ja": "早速、勘違いしてるみたいだな。\nいいか、今日ここに来たのは……。", "zh": "看来你马上就误会了呢。\n听好了，今天来这里是为了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9e6c6f763e94d6b7275b57f4eb5e21db2e17470ef598903b08f2013ea8cbfb37", "ja": "（茜に、宣材写真というものについて説明した。\nこれで理解してくれるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（我向小茜说明了宣传照的用意，\n希望这样能让她理解……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "20e209c15cc868555345865cd3179e63212be041ac2cd85aff80e91b4707f87f", "ja": "なるほどなるほど、かくかくしかじかだね！\n茜ちゃん賢いから、ざっくり把握したよ！", "zh": "原来如此原来如此，就是这样这样那样那样是吧！\n小茜很聪明，已经掌握大致情况了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "40fbc917397e64b0456830d13b1b48816fe570a406d8ee6e3c88e123acc271bc", "ja": "それじゃさっそく撮ってもらおうよ、宣材写真！\n茜ちゃん伝説の1ページ目をね……！", "zh": "那就赶快去拍吧，拍宣传照！\n拍下小茜传说的第一页……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "46678295285934772f7bbeb1155d927d627aa4c00712dc1181f40dcac3ba3e7b", "ja": "（その後、撮影は……難航した）", "zh": "（之后的拍照过程……困难重重。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "bbbabe9b85e10f5639cd4a7c316f8d9c015643ef7d0e419ee072f070a9ec8762", "ja": "いっくよー！\nてやっ、あらぶる何かのポーズ！", "zh": "要开始啰──！\n喝呀，这是某种凶猛生物的姿势！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_1009", "source_sha256": "4bae448b8cc502f30a93f71218107f56f28e6fafa75644622ff305df16c1267c", "ja": "もうちょっとかわいく", "zh": "再可爱一点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "b92efecd9800445d84b19bab77105e4a76883d2dbfff843fbdcdbf1b0ca6566e", "ja": "アイドルというか、ヒーローっぽいな……\nもうちょっと、かわいく！", "zh": "与其说是偶像，这更像英雄呢……\n再可爱一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_2001_023aka", "source_sha256": "14ab9b7354e9b4fcbfcfec44793df2882c4d27101c7df26a07dc3d58f8fb27e2", "ja": "なら、これならどうだー！\nモエモエ～な感じの、何か♪", "zh": "那么，这样如何──！\n这是某种萌物的姿势♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_2002", "source_sha256": "363cb536b8523b319db5d79046deffe0bbe21849173014c1189501f9f89ccc76", "ja": "ちょっと違う", "zh": "不太对", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_3000_p", "source_sha256": "1ab92d3e9f902ff80570d841dca2a25740de81d8f31215841c2f0dc893194052", "ja": "可愛いと言っても、そういう方向じゃないな。\nもっとストレートな可愛さで頼む！", "zh": "虽说可爱，但不是那种方向。\n要直接地展现自己的可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_3001_023aka", "source_sha256": "6c917e02b2ef40511dcba39a97e0006904b5de05802e66d0ebc5c7b9cdbc9c22", "ja": "茜ちゃん……もう逃げないっ！\nハァッ！　メタモルフォーーーゼ！！", "zh": "小茜……再也不逃避了！\n喝！梦幻变身───！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_3002", "source_sha256": "6b0196552db4194bda0a262df40513509469c1a158d386dc9ca816a8612abc94", "ja": "ネタに走るな", "zh": "别开始搞笑", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4000_p", "source_sha256": "2c544d7e855d9955f51d63a163929945a460d6ad0302a65c511c1e346e66c621", "ja": "ほとんど元に戻ってるじゃないか……。\nというか、どんどん遠くなってるぞ！", "zh": "你这样几乎回到原点了啊……\n而且根本越差越远嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4001_p", "source_sha256": "0aa973df964d24650947df3738238897a57159e883f46e2618a1fa74e203579b", "ja": "（その後もリテイクにリテイクを重ね、\nアイドルらしく修正していった結果……）", "zh": "（之后也不断地重拍，\n调整成比较像偶像的姿势后……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4002_023aka", "source_sha256": "70a7e40b40aa8c0a65d32beee379f638dee35e1d31df4f1b42565b1f8b92eea2", "ja": "やっふぅ～♪　コレだよ、コレコレ！\nこういう感じに撮ってもらいたかったんだよ！", "zh": "呀呼～♪就是这样，这样这样！\n小茜就是想拍成这样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4003_023aka", "source_sha256": "f4e98596722db69d6511dea295f0722ec01a7045858d5ccb07da893e414ac01e", "ja": "隠しても隠しきれない、にじみ出るカワいさ……\nまさに、茜ちゃんの狙いどおり！", "zh": "想藏也藏不住、自然散发的可爱感……\n这就是小茜的目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4004_023aka", "source_sha256": "9f02719238920b7b626bba0b529f53f99e161a266bc76128c09ff578856acb4b", "ja": "何もかも茜ちゃんの指示通りだ！\nぐっじょぶ、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "一切都顺利按小茜的指示进行了！\nGood job，小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4005_p", "source_sha256": "55accb223299d3419e76c370d4191df47edfedb88dcaef60edf91a0abd6b7002", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nそれは……よかった……。", "zh": "是、是吗……\n那真是……太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4006_023aka", "source_sha256": "3a6f3d131b4be5d59e42c6bdd3e2239bfdf1eaef4c1ce0f45d5fa68f730e3fc1", "ja": "あれ？　どうしたの、疲れ切った顔して？\nこれくらいでへこたれてるようじゃ、ダ・メ・だ・ぞ♪", "zh": "奇怪？你怎么啦，好像满脸疲累？\n这点程度就累瘫可、不、行、喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4007_023aka", "source_sha256": "52369811bf0dfbba086850382d4f535c92932c26eaec35b14befdc6f65e2e513", "ja": "あっ。もしかして{$P$}ちゃんが\n疲れてるのって、茜ちゃんのせいだったりする？", "zh": "啊，该不会小{$P$}之所以这么累，\n都是因为小茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4008_p", "source_sha256": "446c275bd8121dbb5680689e4da5abe075fedfeb929c6297fc8c2132fc4c6169", "ja": "（茜……ようやく気づいてくれたのか！）", "zh": "（茜……你终于察觉到了吗！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4009_023aka", "source_sha256": "2b897acfa588241a40d4c1757cc2dde69fff712b05f42db0c333d32dd01109ea", "ja": "やっぱりそうなんだ！　茜ちゃんがカワいすぎて、\n{$P$}ちゃんには刺激が強すぎたと！", "zh": "果然是这样！因为小茜太可爱，\n对小{$P$}来说太刺激了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4011_023aka", "source_sha256": "93f9395dbcac60c47be42e81419397f93e69b6e17e72e7d37d141db5dc65a67b", "ja": "今日はゆっくり休んでね♪　特別に、カワイイカワイイ\n茜ちゃんを、夢に見てもいい権利をあげるから！", "zh": "你今天要好好休息喔♪\n给你特权，让你能梦到可爱到不行的小茜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4012_p", "source_sha256": "ae8478ed595b28bff3367dcd97aef57429fded3a0403f15b7beaeb69ab38472c", "ja": "いや……その権利は遠慮するよ。\n茜が夢に出てきたら、逆に眠れなさそうだ……。", "zh": "不……这种特权就不用了。\n要是梦到小茜，感觉反而会睡不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4013_023aka", "source_sha256": "6fcf4813464b84eaeafeea3dfc660ddf29565ca40baeab6f41af4e4bf88ad58b", "ja": "えーーー！？　{$P$}ちゃんってば、\nそんなコト言うとモテないよ！　モテないんだからー！", "zh": "咦───！？小{$P$}真是的，\n说这种话会不受欢迎喔！会不受欢迎的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_023aka_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_023aka_002_4014_p", "source_sha256": "456dc7defcec1274ffee5f789e5066c9b2b24ed1397115322e1007b7c692f85c", "ja": "（理由は、わかってもらえなかったが……\nいい写真が撮れてよかった……）", "zh": "（看来没能让她理解原因……\n但还好有拍到好照片……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
